Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.12) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [linbo] "lmncli linbo lastsync -l" also shows the last OS start of
     each device and the name of the started OS, read from its
     linbo.log. The csv and raw exports get "Last start" and "Last
     started OS" columns.
   * [samba] "lmncli samba lastlogin" shows the hostname of the client,
     resolved from devices.csv, and no longer lists the administrator
     account.
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.20).
